# Repository hygiene for a remote origin.
# Rule of thumb: commit what a reader needs to understand and rebuild the
# result -- code, configs, prose, the small measured summaries under
# reports/ -- and ignore everything that is fetched, generated, measured at
# run time, or produced by local tooling.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Corpus, vector index, embedding cache (ADR-0003: fetch or rebuild)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# data/raw/     cloned upstream documentation (nested .git, ~15 MB)
# data/chunks/  chunker output (~18 MB)
# data/corpus/  normalized documents
# data/index/   Qdrant collections (~160 MB)
# data/cache/   sqlite embedding cache (~85 MB)
data/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
.qdrant/
qdrant_storage/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Experiment outputs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Every cell writes an immutable runs/<run_id>/ directory: answers, retrieved
# chunks, per-item scores, vectors. Hundreds of MB, reproducible from
# configs/ + scripts/. The numbers the report cites live in reports/.
runs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Model weights and large binary blobs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.npz
*.npy
*.h5
*.pkl
*.joblib

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI coding agents / orchestration scratch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Working state of the coding agents that drive this repository: one-off
# probes, screenshots, session logs, the local ticket tracker. Not part of
# the deliverable. (AGENTS.md and docs/agents/ are documentation and stay.)
.scratch/
.wt08-scratch/
.agent/
.agents/
.claude/
.codex/
.cursor/
.specstory/
.aider*
*.agent.md
PROMPT.md
agent-*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Chainlit runtime
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Chainlit rewrites .files/ and .chainlit/translations/ on every import and
# regenerates the welcome screen. .chainlit/config.toml is the theme and is
# checked in.
.files/
.chainlit/translations/
.chainlit/.files/
.chainlit/*.log
chainlit.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs and local run output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.err
*.out
*.pid
demo-capture.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytype/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets.*
credentials.*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS and editor
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Archives and temporary files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.7z
*.rar
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
